WEBVTT

00:19.820 --> 00:24.291
The wound inside
my sealed memories

00:24.291 --> 00:28.629
When it silently touches the heart

00:28.629 --> 00:36.331
Tears of loneliness behind
the gentle smile

00:36.637 --> 00:41.342
I seek boundless strength

00:41.342 --> 00:52.252
I continue to run up with
what I believe in

00:52.252 --> 00:54.355
I want to protect

00:54.355 --> 00:56.623
I want to believe

00:56.623 --> 01:00.794
all the reasons for that smile

01:00.794 --> 01:05.254
The heat and the love

01:05.299 --> 01:09.236
I accept them all

01:09.236 --> 01:13.173
I won't let go of your hand again

01:13.173 --> 01:21.842
Aiming towards that light...

01:30.557 --> 01:34.288
Previously on Shonen Onmyouji...

01:37.297 --> 01:41.427
This is the power to kill a deity,
the fire of Kagutsuchi.

01:45.939 --> 01:50.569
The ability to destroy
a deity now resides in you.

01:51.879 --> 01:55.282
But first, you'll need
an object to contain it.

01:55.282 --> 01:57.151
Don't look so worried.

01:57.151 --> 02:00.746
All you have to do is
borrow Suzaku's sword.

02:01.088 --> 02:06.253
I met Takao no Kami and she's
lent me the fire of Kagutsuchi.

02:07.261 --> 02:11.163
I will... kill Guren!

02:11.432 --> 02:13.559
I see.

02:14.768 --> 02:17.566
I'll go borrow
the sword from Suzaku.

02:27.815 --> 02:30.841
It's been a long time,
Abe no Seimei.

02:32.853 --> 02:35.845
Dancing Junipers
in the Whirl of Miasma

02:39.026 --> 02:44.598
Ryusai... No, you are not
Ryusai anymore.

02:44.598 --> 02:46.767
Chishiki no Guuji.

02:46.767 --> 02:50.104
So he's Chishiki no Guuji.

02:50.104 --> 02:54.942
That's right, Chishiki no Guuji
possessed Ryusai's body!

02:54.942 --> 02:59.580
I knew you'd show up,
Abe no Seimei...

02:59.580 --> 03:02.716
and your shikigami.

03:02.716 --> 03:06.386
But it seems like
you've come too late.

03:06.386 --> 03:10.858
As you can see,
the first seal has been opened.

03:10.858 --> 03:13.160
All that's left is the seal to
the path of the underworld,

03:13.160 --> 03:17.064
which lies deep
in the sanctuary.

03:17.064 --> 03:21.568
And Touda is already on
his way there.

03:21.568 --> 03:27.040
Unfortunately, I can't allow you
to go beyond this point.

03:27.040 --> 03:31.979
Come, you creatures of the
underworld. Slaughter them!

03:31.979 --> 03:33.674
Go!

03:34.982 --> 03:39.009
Foolish creatures that lived in
the miasma more than 50 years!

03:41.355 --> 03:43.949
What hideous creatures!

03:46.927 --> 03:49.630
Wait! Masahiro...

03:49.630 --> 03:53.867
Don't worry,
leave everything to us.

03:53.867 --> 03:58.939
The miasma's getting thicker, so
Chishiki no Guuji's gaining power.

03:58.939 --> 04:03.876
You go on ahead
and protect the portal.

04:04.978 --> 04:09.176
Seiryuu! Kouchin!
Both of you go with Masahiro!

04:09.283 --> 04:13.583
Clear the path for him.
Guide him to the last seal!

04:13.654 --> 04:15.645
I understand.

04:22.162 --> 04:24.323
Masahiro?

04:31.305 --> 04:33.296
Hurry up and go!

04:39.913 --> 04:43.940
- Keep up with me.
- Go!

04:49.890 --> 04:52.125
I will not let you pass!

04:52.125 --> 04:55.117
[chant]

05:01.235 --> 05:04.404
- Darn you!
- Chishiki no Guuji...

05:04.404 --> 05:07.100
Your opponent is me!

05:08.442 --> 05:13.280
He's just a child.
What can he do?

05:13.280 --> 05:20.083
This is perfect. Abe no Seimei,
I will destroy you myself!

05:38.538 --> 05:42.634
The Chibiki rock...
the last seal.

05:43.110 --> 05:48.946
If I break it, the warriors of the
underworld will invade this land.

06:01.028 --> 06:08.201
This is forbidden. No one
is allowed to touch the seal!

06:08.201 --> 06:13.106
I see, so there's also
a guardian for this door.

06:13.106 --> 06:15.438
What an irritating guardian!

06:26.620 --> 06:30.524
It is forbidden
to touch the seal!

06:30.524 --> 06:34.494
The most powerful guardian
is placed at the last seal.

06:34.494 --> 06:39.193
Chishiki should have
destroyed this one first!

06:49.509 --> 06:52.034
Ten thousand demons, enfold!

06:53.814 --> 06:58.649
Well, it wouldn't be
amusing otherwise.

06:58.985 --> 07:03.615
But your shikigami
are disturbances.

07:04.558 --> 07:06.992
If that's the case...

07:15.702 --> 07:19.638
[chant]

07:31.318 --> 07:35.789
Taiin! Return to the tunnel
with Genbu and Byakko now!

07:35.789 --> 07:39.159
- What do you mean?
- They're going underground.

07:39.159 --> 07:42.754
Those creatures are going
to escape from the tunnel.

07:45.866 --> 07:51.071
- What will you do now?
- Purge the miasma...

07:51.071 --> 07:54.875
and destroy all the demons
that are trying to escape!

07:54.875 --> 07:58.211
- I understand!
- Genbu, let's go!

07:58.211 --> 08:01.681
- I'm going to stay here!
- Genbu!

08:01.681 --> 08:03.517
What are you talking about?

08:03.517 --> 08:06.975
My job is to protect Seimei!

08:07.053 --> 08:10.624
It's vital that we protect
the people first.

08:10.624 --> 08:14.895
Use your powers to clear and
prevent the miasma from spreading.

08:14.895 --> 08:19.195
- But then...
- Listen Genbu, don't worry.

08:19.232 --> 08:22.292
It's not my time to go yet.

08:23.470 --> 08:26.200
Time is the essence here.

08:28.642 --> 08:30.940
Let's go!

08:33.513 --> 08:39.252
Planning to fight me all
by yourself? What a fool!

08:39.252 --> 08:42.085
Really, I wonder...

08:44.191 --> 08:50.289
[chant]

08:56.470 --> 09:02.809
Chishiki no Guuji, I may be old,
but my powers are still strong.

09:02.809 --> 09:06.677
There's no reason
for you to patronize me.

09:17.457 --> 09:19.857
Monsters from
the underworld!

09:20.827 --> 09:23.295
I forbid you to pass!

09:24.931 --> 09:27.868
Be gone!

09:27.868 --> 09:29.859
Take that!

09:38.345 --> 09:42.616
What's this? A sideway?

09:42.616 --> 09:45.244
- Taiin?
- I'll be right back!

09:55.395 --> 10:00.100
Finally... finally!

10:00.100 --> 10:04.833
That is... the Guardian Spirit
of the Returning Path?

10:15.048 --> 10:21.283
Our unfinished business 55 years
ago... let's settle it today!

10:21.321 --> 10:24.654
Try and see if you can!

10:31.932 --> 10:35.663
[chant]

10:39.773 --> 10:41.365
Shatter!

10:49.449 --> 10:55.455
- Darn you!
- It ends here, Chishiki no Guuji.

10:55.455 --> 10:59.960
Seimei, are you
going to kill me?

10:59.960 --> 11:03.229
- Ryusai...
- You...

11:03.229 --> 11:07.834
Are you going to kill a friend?

11:07.834 --> 11:10.937
Is this what all your spells
are for?

11:10.937 --> 11:15.709
You are not Ryusai!

11:15.709 --> 11:18.378
Seimei, please save me!

11:18.378 --> 11:21.414
Chishiki no Guuji, darn you!

11:21.414 --> 11:25.385
Chishiki no Guuji's
controlling me...

11:25.385 --> 11:30.982
- Seimei, please save me!
- Ryusai...

11:39.933 --> 11:41.234
Ryusai?

11:41.234 --> 11:46.638
I'll keep you company.
It's boring to drink alone.

11:48.541 --> 11:53.880
Just come out and say it.
You need my help, right?

11:53.880 --> 11:58.752
What? You mean those are
the kind of people around you?

11:58.752 --> 12:04.918
The people who talk to me
all want the same thing.

12:05.892 --> 12:10.997
Water?
Hey you! This is...

12:10.997 --> 12:16.765
Seimei, why don't you use your
best spell to change this to wine?

12:19.072 --> 12:22.075
You're so weird.

12:22.075 --> 12:24.703
It takes one to know one.

12:28.682 --> 12:30.707
Ryusai...

12:34.087 --> 12:38.285
- Wake up, Ryusai!
- Shut up!

12:42.595 --> 12:48.501
My friend, Enoki Ryusai...
He no longer exists!

12:48.501 --> 12:50.336
Seimei...

12:50.336 --> 12:54.340
I'll never forgive you
for desecrating his body!

12:54.340 --> 12:56.643
Stop it, Seimei!

12:56.643 --> 12:59.546
Hidden warriors,
formidable soldiers!

12:59.546 --> 13:05.685
In that case, you shall die!

13:05.685 --> 13:08.984
Assemble and take
formation against the enemy!

13:11.858 --> 13:16.629
Scorching flower of
dazzling light, do it now!

13:16.629 --> 13:18.620
Slash!

13:26.339 --> 13:32.212
You seem to be having
a little trouble with your spell.

13:32.212 --> 13:38.885
Your separation spell seems
to be draining your powers.

13:38.885 --> 13:43.957
Can the decrepit body you
left in the capital take this?

13:43.957 --> 13:46.326
I-I'm not done yet!

13:46.326 --> 13:49.955
If you push yourself,
you'll die, Seimei.

13:53.366 --> 13:56.858
You will lose.
Prepare yourself!

14:08.848 --> 14:13.319
- Are you okay, Seimei?
- Rikugou?

14:13.319 --> 14:17.791
Rikugou, is Kazane?

14:17.791 --> 14:20.927
- I see...
- Seimei...

14:20.927 --> 14:23.096
Just let me finish him off.

14:23.096 --> 14:25.665
Being a shikigami...

14:25.665 --> 14:30.103
you still want to kill a human
being? How interesting.

14:30.103 --> 14:34.474
Nonsense!
That's just an empty shell.

14:34.474 --> 14:38.672
You've taken control of it,
as if it's still alive!

14:39.712 --> 14:43.716
- What an impudent shikigami!
- Chishiki no Guuji...

14:43.716 --> 14:47.584
Your scheme ends here!

14:49.923 --> 14:52.158
Deity of Ibukitononushi,

14:52.158 --> 14:56.891
banish him to that faraway land,
deep in the bowels of the earth.

14:57.297 --> 15:00.824
You will not succeed, Seimei!

15:13.213 --> 15:15.882
Eight-layered clouds
of the skies,

15:15.882 --> 15:19.613
come forth and
disperse this whirlwind of evil.

15:29.429 --> 15:33.933
I hate to say this, but
there was already a hole here.

15:33.933 --> 15:36.993
And it's all Touda's doing.

15:38.104 --> 15:42.473
Ibuki! Ibuki!
I summon you now!

15:44.944 --> 15:48.539
Become sacred Ibuki!

16:08.368 --> 16:11.537
Looks like Seimei did it!

16:11.537 --> 16:15.842
- It seems like it.
- Hurry! I have to tell Seimei this!

16:15.842 --> 16:18.276
What's the matter, Taiin?

16:21.147 --> 16:22.548
It's not over yet!

16:22.548 --> 16:27.110
Don't forget Touda, who's
become a creature of the dead.

16:27.720 --> 16:33.681
Shut up!
I can't forgive you! Never!

16:49.509 --> 16:54.572
- Thank you, Seimei...
- Ryusai...

16:55.248 --> 17:00.049
Rest in peace, my dear friend.

17:20.039 --> 17:23.770
Seimei!

17:24.644 --> 17:28.478
Follow me, Seimei!
The Miko of the Returning Path...

17:35.521 --> 17:39.787
So this is where
you've been kept, Miko.

17:41.194 --> 17:49.469
You were cursed and put into
an enchanted sleep for 50 years.

17:49.469 --> 17:56.602
Without sound or form, leaving
a heart of unspeakable pain.

18:11.591 --> 18:15.527
Oh... Miko!

18:30.777 --> 18:34.873
Miko of the Returning Path.
Are you all right?

18:38.351 --> 18:42.355
Seimei, where are we?

18:42.355 --> 18:45.758
You're in a room of ice,
inside a tunnel.

18:45.758 --> 18:50.396
Chishiki no Guuji cast a spell
on you and left you here.

18:50.396 --> 18:54.628
Chishiki no Guuji?

18:55.668 --> 19:00.901
Kazane! My child!
Where's Kazane?

19:02.075 --> 19:06.637
Seimei, do you know
where my daughter is?

19:08.314 --> 19:13.217
- This...
- What? This is...

19:14.020 --> 19:19.759
This is Kazane's.
But why do you have it?

19:19.759 --> 19:21.761
Kazane is no longer...

19:21.761 --> 19:30.965
It can't be...
Kazane... but why would she...

19:34.340 --> 19:38.744
Rikugou and the guardian
spirit will take care of this.

19:38.744 --> 19:41.736
The rest of us
must find, Masahiro.

19:49.155 --> 19:52.056
Guren is nearby.

19:55.228 --> 20:01.758
Please be all right, Masahiro.
Come back safely.

20:05.671 --> 20:10.108
This must be where
the final seal is.

20:11.477 --> 20:13.468
Guren!

20:20.586 --> 20:26.726
I will not allow someone
like you to touch the seal!

20:26.726 --> 20:30.596
I expected this from the
guardian spirit of the last seal.

20:30.596 --> 20:32.565
Such adamancy.

20:32.565 --> 20:39.338
But it ends here.
Take this!

20:39.338 --> 20:40.965
Kouchin!

20:42.308 --> 20:43.910
Give it to me!

20:43.910 --> 20:46.208
Are you ready for this?

20:56.756 --> 21:01.455
This is Suzaku's sword. It will
hold the fire of Kagutsuchi.

21:03.429 --> 21:07.466
Once you've transferred the
deity's power into this sword,

21:07.466 --> 21:12.438
you will have the ability
to kill a deity.

21:12.438 --> 21:15.703
The power to kill a deity...

21:18.477 --> 21:21.412
I'll go on ahead.

21:42.168 --> 21:54.480
Everyone, as time passes,
loses sight of his dreams

21:54.480 --> 22:05.558
Errors and pains are repeated
through the ages

22:05.558 --> 22:11.397
Why do we resist believing
in each other?

22:11.397 --> 22:17.597
Why do we put out
the light of fate?

22:19.405 --> 22:29.715
I want to protect our future
with this hand

22:29.715 --> 22:36.389
Because you taught me

22:36.389 --> 22:41.761
What it means to challenge
with all my strength

22:41.761 --> 22:47.466
You will keep overcoming
your limits

22:47.466 --> 22:54.463
Surely surely surely

23:00.179 --> 23:03.114
Next Episode

23:24.303 --> 23:26.072
Next on Shonen Onmyouji...

23:26.072 --> 23:27.173
Final Episode.

23:27.173 --> 23:29.733
Final Episode
Sharpen and Polish
the Blade of Fire
Sharpen and Polish
the Blade of Fire.
